---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { site } from "../config/site";
import { withBase } from "../lib/paths";
---

<Base title={`Privacy — ${site.name}`} titleZh={`隐私说明 — ${site.name}`}>
  <article class="container legal-page">
    <a class="text-button" href={withBase("/")} data-zh={`← 返回 ${site.name}`}>
      ← Back to {site.name}
    </a>
    <span class="eyebrow" data-zh="关于你的信息">
      YOUR INFORMATION
    </span>
    <h1 data-zh="关于隐私，说清楚。">Privacy, in plain language.</h1>
    <p
      data-zh={`本页说明当你浏览 ${site.name} 网站或提交项目咨询时，我们如何处理相关信息。`}
    >
      This page explains how the {site.name} website handles information when
      you explore the site or submit a project inquiry.
    </p>
    <h2 data-zh="项目咨询">Project inquiries</h2>
    <p
      data-zh={`提交表单并勾选同意后，你提供的姓名、邮箱、机构、感兴趣方向和项目说明会通过 Cloudflare 服务保存，以便 ${site.name} 回复你的咨询。请勿提交保密研究资料或敏感个人信息。你也可以选择不提交表单，直接通过邮件联系我们。`}
    >
      When you submit the form and give consent, your name, email, organization,
      area of interest, and project details are stored using Cloudflare services
      so {site.name} can respond. Please do not submit confidential research or
      sensitive personal information. You can also contact us directly by email.
    </p>
    <h2 data-zh="你选择分享的信息">What you choose to share</h2>
    <p data-zh="如果你联系我们，我们会收到你提供的姓名、邮箱、机构名称及项目信息，并使用这些信息回复和讨论你的项目。分享保密研究资料或敏感个人信息前，请先与我们沟通。">
      We use submitted inquiry details only to respond and discuss your project.
      We do not publish or provide them through a public lookup service.
    </p>
    <h2 data-zh="显示偏好">Display preferences</h2>
    <p data-zh="当你切换语言或深浅色主题时，偏好会保存在设备的浏览器中，以便下次访问时沿用。">
      When you switch languages or change between light and dark themes, your
      preferences are stored locally on your device so the website can remember
      them on your next visit.
    </p>
    <h2 data-zh="数据保存与删除">Storage and deletion</h2>
    <p data-zh="咨询记录保存在 Cloudflare D1 数据库中，仅用于回复咨询和后续沟通。我们目前没有自动删除期限；如需查询或删除你的记录，请使用下方邮箱联系我们。">
      Inquiry records are held in a Cloudflare D1 database and used for replies
      and related follow-up. Records are not currently deleted on an automatic
      schedule. Email us below to request access to or deletion of your record.
    </p>
    <h2 data-zh="Cookie 与访问统计">Cookies and analytics</h2>
    <p data-zh="本网站不使用广告 Cookie、访问分析追踪器或第三方在线字体。为提供和保护网站服务，托管服务商可能处理 IP 地址、访问日志等常规技术请求信息。">
      This website does not use advertising cookies, analytics trackers, or
      third-party web fonts. A hosting provider may process standard technical
      request information, such as IP addresses and access logs, to deliver and
      secure the website.
    </p>
    <h2 data-zh="疑问或删除请求">Questions or deletion requests</h2>
    <p>
      <span data-zh="如需询问你向我们提供的信息或申请删除，请发送邮件至：">
        To ask about information you have shared with us or request its
        deletion, email
      </span>{" "}
      <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>
